            <ArticleTitle>Treatment of voiding complaints and incontinence in painful bladder syndrome.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>317-25</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The treatment of voiding complaints and incontinence in painful bladder syndrome requires careful attention to detail. As the exact nature of these conditions is unknown, no single modality is effective, and multiple treatments may be required. A sympathetic and supportive physician is necessary in all these cases.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
